{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1351","id":3995320963,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87uI8KD","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1351","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1351.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1351.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1351","number":1351,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[SEM-KG-HVY-10] Generate full 3530 semantic KG raw candidate layer","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nAddresses #1324.\n\nThis PR adds the full SEM-KG-HVY-10 raw candidate layer in local/no-auth mode. It uses the checked-in 3530-row `full-beta-runtime-source-map.v1.json` universe, carries forward the 3 provenance-valid no-auth pilot raw candidates, and emits deterministic terminal no-auth blockers for the remaining 3527 rows rather than fabricating semantic assertions.\n\n## Artifacts\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-full-raw-candidate-layer.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-full-raw-candidate-layer.no-auth-receipts.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-full-raw-candidate-layer.validator-result.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-full-raw-candidate-layer.readback.md`\n\n## Counts\n\n- Universe rows represented: 3530\n- Raw candidate rows: 3\n- Raw candidates: 3\n- Terminal blocker rows: 3527\n- No-auth receipts: 3530\n- Accepted/provisional/triangulated promoted edges: 0\n- External model/API calls: 0\n- Supabase mutations: 0\n- Frontend/UI changes: 0\n- Production RAG reindex: 0\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-full-raw-candidate-layer.mjs --write` -> pass, validator status `pass`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-candidate-generator-harness.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-bounded-pilot-candidates.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-pilot-error-audit.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-full-raw-candidate-layer.test.js` -> 4 suites, 24 tests passed\n- `npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-full-raw-candidate-layer.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-full-raw-candidate-layer.test.js` -> pass\n- `npm run lint:changed -- --base b068d32292562bc5b4b1d8133218e86219f76915 --json` -> ok, 1 checked file, 0 regressions\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> warning only for branch naming/ahead-of-origin; worktree clean\n\n## Blockers / Limits\n\nNo fresh external model authorization was present for full-scale semantic candidate generation, so rows without local raw candidate support are terminal `model_skipped_no_auth` / `blocked_quarantined` receipts. No accepted or provisional semantic graph layer is promoted in this PR.","created_at":"2026-07-06T00:36:01Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T01:17:14Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T01:17:14Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T01:17:14Z","merge_commit_sha":"0eca387024cdb0983e884c7fd502ccef7273efe4","assignee